{"id":"n64612-1-10","stage":1,"title":"수영복 · 泳衣","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64612-1-10-1","ko":"우리 수영장에 놀러 가자.","zh":"去游泳池玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수영장에","meaning":"游泳场，游泳池","explanation":"수영장：游泳场，游泳池；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수영장","audio":"/audio/b458b878d51b2c8d51db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26858","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"b458b878d51b2c8d","term":"수영장","zh":"游泳场，游泳池","audio":"/audio/b458b878d51b2c8d51db.mp3","entryId":"26858","definition":"具备游泳玩水或举行游泳比赛的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["수영장"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e9500ac112519812d9f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64612-1-10-2","ko":"싫어. 나는 살쪄서 수영복을 입기 싫단 말이야.","zh":"不要，我胖了，不想穿泳衣。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"싫어.","meaning":"不愿意，不想","explanation":"싫다：不愿意，不想；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"2","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살쪄서","meaning":"长胖，发胖","explanation":"살찌다：长胖，发胖；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"살찌다","audio":"/audio/1d3c08522d0dc64a7de0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61615","senseId":"1","lemma":"살찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수영복을","meaning":"泳衣，泳装","explanation":"수영복：泳衣，泳装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수영복","audio":"/audio/fd12c8d9d40ef1a1c56f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64612","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입기","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싫단","meaning":"不愿意，不想","explanation":"싫다：不愿意，不想；단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"2","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"不愿意，不想","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不情愿做某事。","pronunciation":["실타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"1d3c08522d0dc64a","term":"살찌다","zh":"长胖，发胖","audio":"/audio/1d3c08522d0dc64a7de0.mp3","entryId":"61615","definition":"身上肉变多。","pronunciation":["살찌다"]},{"id":"fd12c8d9d40ef1a1","term":"수영복","zh":"泳衣，泳装","audio":"/audio/fd12c8d9d40ef1a1c56f.mp3","entryId":"64612","definition":"游泳时穿的衣服。","pronunciation":["수영복"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5b0a03b4ff9dfac96ac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64612","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.2353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不要，我胖了，不想穿泳衣。","去游泳池玩吧。","敏俊啊，今天是愉快的周五晚上，你怎么还在学习呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去游泳池玩吧。","敏俊啊，今天是愉快的周五晚上，你怎么还在学习呢？","不要，我胖了，不想穿泳衣。"],"answer":2}]}
